  "title": "Cranberry, Cinnamon, and Brown Sugar Steel Cut Oats",
  "description": "Inspired by \"raisins and spice\" varieties of instant oatmeal, this recipe uses steel-cut oats and dried cranberries to elevate a pedestrian breakfast cereal to something special.",
